    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"BatchingAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>BatchingAggregateChange</code></a> implementation for save changes that can contain actions for any mix of insert and\nupdate operations. When consumed, actions are yielded in the appropriate entity tree order with inserts carried out\nfrom root to leaves and deletes in reverse. All operations that can be batched are grouped and combined to offer the\nability for an optimized batch operation to be used.",
      "translation": "一个用于保存变更的<a href=\"BatchingAggregateChange.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>BatchingAggregateChange</code></a>实现，其中可以包含任意组合的插入和更新操作。在消费时，操作将按照适当的实体树顺序产出：插入操作从根节点到叶节点执行，而删除操作则按相反顺序执行。所有可批处理的操作都会被分组并合并，以提供使用优化批处理操作的能力。",
      "count": 1
    },
